    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine._apply_corporate_actions",
     "sha256": "96db81f9726fbc35ab890894197c720a2c866096457b5675a2e4372b52750378"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/quality_growth.py::QualityGrowthStrategy.features",
     "sha256": "ae524be1bd58001469121cfd8b62b67fd0fa2bd35205da120c3bc2fd0345df41"
    }
   ],
   "text": "引擎策略的資料需求為官方日線、T86 三大法人買賣超、MI_MARGN 融資餘額、財務報表、月營收、財報公告日與公司行動（catalog NATIVE_NEEDS）。本策略模組中出現的研究欄位（rule_inputs）為：bb_width、bias、eps、foreign_ratio、kd_k、ma60、macd_hist、op_profit_margin、revenue_yoy、rsi、trust_ratio、volume_ratio；研究橫截面中任一欄位缺值的股票會被排除並記錄原因。持股期間的除權息、減資等公司行動在當日開盤成交前記入持股：股數乘以 share_multiplier 取整、現金配發與零股（以面額 10 元結算）記入現金、成本與停損價依 price_factor 調整。"
  },
  "entry": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.process_close_signals",
     "sha256": "e4f0738b44d9a5f9a3331ae7641055228db124e2ef9dd0ecce4fbccf99202a13"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/db_helper.py::get_market_trend",
     "sha256": "532a5b4d31011ea4116811eceb7c0b3e13b8ace960b779eda24703f1e66ddef8"
    },
    {
     "ref": "config/settings.py::Config.MARKET_SYMBOL",
     "sha256": "e46cc929614e6dde0fe3577d1be745300625d7a0bf0fd9324cca4db5f51bbf20"
    },
    {
     "ref": "scripts/legacy_baseline_run.py::EXECUTION_CONTRACT",
     "sha256": "79431a09450b909627f43e1569805f1ac8ea02dadd5f20ca20b6de63402bb8fd"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.execute_pending_open",
     "sha256": "bf05cceee31f3f6a56ec1793eac5b6cf8f7945a1693d358a5de0b7c9c8d65bb5"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine._open_fill_rejection",
     "sha256": "80aaab55d435f5cbd00231db5c6fc7fd361aa2719e4971469195bbe74ab508f4"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/execution.py::fill_check",
     "sha256": "d9d2fbc40a99b8addb68bbedc542ddfb86ea8203c83276a6a39746fba7d435c4"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/execution.py::limit_prices",
     "sha256": "dcdb2ecf979476e3557c19a39bbbff411fcc260d0f0e0568c295bdf892782752"
    }
   ],
   "text": "引擎每個交易日收盤先處理出場，只有在大盤趨勢標籤為 BULL 時才呼叫選股。BULL 的定義是 Config.MARKET_SYMBOL（2330）當日收盤價高於其 MA60 的 0.95 倍，否則為 BEAR。候選股中尚未持有者以買單在下一個交易日開盤成交（執行契約 next_session_open_v2）。下一交易日開盤價缺漏或無效時買單作廢；前一交易日沒有有效官方收盤價（漲跌停價無法計算）、當日無成交，或開盤即漲停鎖死（開盤 = 最高 = 最低且開盤 ≥ 漲停價）時拒絕成交。"
  },
  "exit": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/base.py::BaseStrategy.check_exit_signal",
     "sha256": "583ddf3b291fe9be16e228bd7d4d0afff5e5726b40e3f3cb582c502e3eb29a10"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.check_and_execute_exit",
     "sha256": "de4e85bc4c258f17e5c1ec3aca7be67b4841db2bbfe2603242e9bf543e3a7cf5"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine._exit_at_signal",
     "sha256": "23f6c8426e2f62adbd5cc2f9bfdc4bce3973bbb313227b4cb94d482dd0e94679"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine._load_params",
     "sha256": "6368f94392e247915e4724884ffa67084f56a8394fb302d651b12f5e3f61f031"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.buy",
     "sha256": "80eac68203c705a89bf7c73158c5cc2c4bb182aa01ae98c50225d7e1889a1500"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.sell",
     "sha256": "839ec42058aad50ee799849ae06e6fe0764526fe85e9919c38114f3b44a8913a"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/quality_growth.py::QualityGrowthStrategy.stop_loss",
     "sha256": "3db6c4bd069298f841f2f4a2e86ce7a1088232ae73a29ddd13324fe5dbd43e9b"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/quality_growth.py::QualityGrowthStrategy.take_profit",
     "sha256": "ecd6a0fd1061e48dd2c05eced4670754143749a791aa1dc0508f2b64bc2aad62"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/quality_growth.py::QualityGrowthStrategy.max_hold_days",
     "sha256": "e110f5bf60a9635c292781b428087ce4127e73dbde6d25ff270000f32a97c81d"
    }
   ],
   "text": "停損 10%、停利 20%、最長持有 60 天，三者都寫死在策略屬性中，不讀設定。引擎在每個交易日收盤先把持有天數加 1，再以當日收盤價判斷出場；當日無行情時不判斷。買進時初始停損價為成交當日開盤價乘以（1 − 停損比例）。階梯式移動停損：收盤報酬達 30% 時停損價上移至成本 × 1.25，達 20% 時上移至成本 × 1.15，達 10% 時上移至成本 × 1.01，停損價只上移不下移。賣出條件依序為：收盤價 ≤ 停損價（停損）、報酬 ≥ 停利比例（停利）、持有天數 ≥ 最長持有天數（時間到）、大盤趨勢為 BEAR 且報酬為負（趨勢轉空）。出場訊號以賣單在下一個交易日開盤執行；賣單被拒絕或只部分成交時，剩餘持股保留，並在之後的收盤再次判斷出場。"
  },
  "factors": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "ref": "core/calc_indicators.py::build_feature_history",
     "sha256": "83afdba30b7493287b67aa7930489d7bae067cef58494509dd874edd72d2480e"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/calc_indicators.py::calculate_ratio_features",
     "sha256": "01bedd000cac214dffb428faccad9087d45257ad143313c4c1a40ab1bbe1df28"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/calc_indicators.py::VOLUME_RATIO_MIN_OBSERVATIONS",
     "sha256": "cd2adc41116fbef2e8f3bcffaa838f7bf5a688458921c5378eafc21820f2de48"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/research/native_frame.py::prepare_fundamentals",
     "sha256": "fb7d6952255d8ab55bfd9d762d4b8cf14ba52b57d9fdfafa67439c62451db658"
    }
   ],
   "text": "ma20、ma60 為 20 日與 60 日收盤均線（最少 10 與 30 筆）；volume_ratio 為成交量 ÷ 20 日平均成交量，截在 0 到 5，成交量觀測少於 20 筆時為缺值。op_profit_margin 為最新可用季報的營業利益 ÷ 營收（營收 > 0 才計算）；eps 為同一份季報的每股盈餘；revenue_yoy 為最新可用月營收的年增率。規則另使用當日收盤價與成交量。"
  },
  "holdings": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::MAX_HOLDINGS",
     "sha256": "1e92a92e5ce2a60e0b4b806554cf7dcc1d63733b9ca84af26b41c9d7452c2121"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine._get_max_holdings",
     "sha256": "2a2737386c61bb398f0ad2b1db0c9e3c96b96166f2f4afddc0b4efd69f2eea13"
    },
    {
     "ref": "config/settings.py::Config.NEWS_BEAR_MAX_HOLDINGS",
     "sha256": "fbc4a9925d7fc03f76d24fdec29818eb4acc0d146a2ca0596818a816c402806e"
    },
    {
     "ref": "core/backtest/runner.py::BacktestEngine.find_candidates",
     "sha256": "67e822acbfea6dd1d093cedf97b210205cb6e2b8340a93d27db36ad33bad29c7"
    },
    {
     "ref": "scripts/legacy_baseline_run.py::config_for",
     "sha256": "734494c0a430d3471c27d73eb6730b3ca392b2aa772274537ef56ec67109d207"
    }
   ],
   "text": "同時最多持有 3 檔（MAX_HOLDINGS）；若當日新聞情緒標記為「偏空」，上限降為 2 檔（Config.NEWS_BEAR_MAX_HOLDINGS）。每天只取選股結果的前 3 檔作為候選；歷史回測使用 rules_only，不套用 AI 模型排序，沿用策略自身的排序。"
  },
  "hypothesis": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "ref": "core/strategies/quality_growth.py::QualityGrowthStrategy.filter_candidates",
     "sha256": "bdc24c0c80a64bcbdca6d4b14802121988dc728fc77681896e2d35f1dac847db"
    }
   ],
   "text": "買進營業利益率高於門檻（預設 > 6%）、月營收年增率為正、EPS > 0、收盤在 60 日均線之上且量比足夠的股票。其經濟想法是：經營效率高且營收成長的獲利公司，股價會隨基本面成長而上漲。"
  },
